    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d407">

                <pb facs="0450" n="1184" sameAs="frus:frus1895p2/pg1184"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Taylor to Mr. Gresham.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >United States Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1895-05-20"><hi rendition="#italic">May 20, 1895</hi></date>.
                        (Received June 3.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 357.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to report the receipt
                    yesterday morning of the following telegram: <quote rend="blockquote">
                        <p>Postpone formal acknowledgment of Spain’s last reply in <hi
                                rendition="#italic">Alliança</hi> affair until instructed by the
                            Department after examination.</p>
                    </quote></p>
                <p>At the same moment I received the Spanish Government’s last reply in the <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Alliança</hi> affair, which I inclose herein, with
                    translations.</p>
                <p>I have simply acknowledged the receipt of this note, stating at the same time
                    that a copy thereof has been forwarded for your consideration.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hannis Taylor.</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d407-a1.xml" xpointer="d407-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
